(The AI-Powered-Placement-Resume-Intelligence-System is an intelligent career technology platform designed to eliminate the) Tj
T* (screening gap between candidates and algorithmic Applicant Tracking Systems \(ATS\). Built upon a high-performance web) Tj
T* (architecture \(React 19, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB\), the application extracts unstructured text from PDF and DOCX) Tj
T* (resumes and executes deep semantic evaluation against target job descriptions using Google Gemini AI. Rather than relying) Tj
T* (on rigid keyword matching, the engine calculates holistic synergy scores, identifies missing competencies, breaks down skill) Tj
T* (ratings, and provides personalized, actionable recommendations that empower candidates to optimize their applications and) Tj
T* (secure placement.) Tj
