(In the modern recruitment landscape, over 75% of candidate resumes are filtered out by automated Applicant) Tj
T* (Tracking Systems \(ATS\) before ever reaching a human recruiter, leaving job seekers—especially students and) Tj
T* (fresh graduates—trapped in a cycle of silent rejections without constructive feedback. Candidates frequently) Tj
T* (struggle to identify critical skill gaps, lack insight into how automated screening algorithms evaluate their profiles) Tj
T* (against specific job descriptions, and often cannot afford expensive professional career coaching services.) Tj
T* (Consequently, qualified applicants fail to advance simply due to semantic misalignment, missing domain) Tj
T* (keywords, or improper resume structuring. The AI-Powered-Placement-Resume-Intelligence-System addresses) Tj
T* (this challenge by providing an intelligent evaluation platform that parses resumes, performs semantic matching) Tj
T* (against target job descriptions using Google Gemini AI, accurately highlights missing skills, and delivers) Tj
T* (actionable, real-time ATS optimization tips to significantly enhance candidate employability.) Tj
